{"reviewId": "227867391_83kl5idue", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "想到了《翦商》有一部分讲商朝的起源，早期过于顺利的扩张给商王朝带来了被异族文化渗透和入侵的隐患。我们以为的红利，往往只是历史的某个阶段投机的差值。得到只是失去的开始，欲望满足的瞬间同时迎来偿还的时刻。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "31051-31119", "abstract": "虽然大宗商品处于康波意义上的熊市，但其价格依然会跟随中周期波动，而中周期第三库存周期往往是滞胀阶段，所以出现大宗商品中周期反弹顺理成章。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "227867391_83kl5idue", "userVid": 227867391, "topics": [], "createTime": 1758441010, "userEditTime": 1758441050, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 227867391, "name": "思凡Captain", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0015-dIsUMctxmg4I0960cNZl810/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "思凡Captain", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 293846797, "name": "江月👑", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0005-6OXrwH_1dPc1386kE5ASE10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "江月👑", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240909-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "给wmls点赞👍🏻", "reviewId": "227867391_83kl5idue", "commentId": "227867391_83kl5idue_c64609780_88yNz9B3t", "userVid": 64609780, "createTime": 177687